          "description": "**参数解释**:\nTop SQL的调用频率占比。\n**取值范围**:\n0-100。",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "0.01"
        },
        "io_percent": {
          "description": "**参数解释**:\nTop SQL的IO开销占比。\n**取值范围**:\n0-100。",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "0.02"
